sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant Root as Switch.Root
  participant Ctx as SwitchRootContext
  participant Thumb as Switch.Thumb

  Root->>Ctx: provide { checked, disabled }
  Ctx->>Thumb: read state
  Note over Root,Thumb: both project the same data-* attributes

  User->>Root: click
  Root->>Root: useControlled setter
  Root-->>User: onCheckedChange(next)
  Root->>Ctx: new state
  Ctx->>Thumb: re-render, data-checked flips
